  "snippet": "Copernicus Emergency Management Service (CEMS) Global Flood Monitoring (GFM) v4.1.1 officially rolled out on June 11, 2026, integrating Sentinel-1D SAR data into the operational workflow. The Sentinel-1 constellation (A, C, D) is now fully feeding GFM for global flood monitoring. This ensures SAR-based flood detection continuity during Sentinel-1C orbital reconfiguration (Jun 9-23).",
